Package: zclockid
Version: 1.0.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Inet Secure Labs <noc@inetcsc.com>
Depends: samba (>= 2:4.19.0), samba-dsdb-modules, samba-vfs-modules, smbclient, winbind, libpam-winbind, libnss-winbind, krb5-user, bind9 (>= 1:9.18.0), bind9utils, bind9-dnsutils, freeradius, freeradius-utils, freeradius-ldap, nginx, snmpd, chrony, acl, attr, python3, python3-pip
Description: Purpose-built Active Directory Domain Controller and IAM appliance
 ZclockID is a modern, lightweight Active Directory Domain Controller and IAM appliance
 engineered for Ubuntu Linux. Features native BIND9 DLZ with DNS-over-HTTPS (DoH),
 FreeRADIUS 802.1X transparent authentication, bi-directional Sysvol replication with
 automatic Windows NTACL preservation, Net-SNMP telemetry, and a headless REST API.

